code: 0
--- stdout
Pass it to someone

  From:      any status
  To:        the status is not changed
  Requires:  --assignee
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Assign:    the --assignee user (a login, or @me for you); other assignees stay
             one who cannot be assigned issues in the repository is exit code 1, with who can
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               Over to @{assignee}.

Usage:
  gh dojo pass <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --assignee string   the user to assign: a login, or @me for yourself
      --dry-run           print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help              help for pass

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
